// title: Sniffing Out UNC3944 on Teams
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Identity
// tables: IdentityInfo, MessageEvents, MessageUrlInfo
// purpose: Sniffing Out UNC3944 on Teams
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/Sniffing%20Out%20UNC3944%20on%20Teams.kql
// kind: repo
